prompts.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept.
Create ONE high-resolution GAME ART ASSET STYLE SHEET on a solid opaque warm ivory background for the same homestead game in the reference. Reference image locks the exact paint treatment, palette, cottage and prop identity. Fresh standalone object drawings, not cropped or cut from the reference. No phone and no interface.
Project: an existing Chinese slime companion and homestead game. Redesign art direction named 林间绘本. Cross-platform neutral mobile game, 2D hand-painted gouache background with subtle paper grain, rounded forms and carefully shaded front-facing building facades; orthographic elevated top-down ground with screen-aligned x/y axes, never a diamond/isometric island. Ground fills the viewport. Moss and fern greens #78916B #A7BB84, warm cream #F5EAD6, weathered honey wood #A98057, terracotta roof #BB795F, muted teal pond #82B7AC, charcoal olive text #334B3D. Selective warm amber glow only in lanterns/windows. Readable silhouettes, broad quiet color masses, low texture on floor and stronger brush detail on object edges, no repeated V-shaped grass pattern. One fixed sun upper left, short soft cast shadows lower right. Same cottage: compact cream plaster walls, rounded terracotta gabled shingle roof, brown arched door centered, one warm rectangular side window, tiny potted flowers and stone doorstep. Branch-and-plank facilities with restrained curved trim and canvas awnings, credible construction, not mushroom houses. Slimes must preserve existing plump low dome silhouette and two small upright black oval eyes, tiny faint mouth, one large upper-left pale highlight, golden honey body; do not add limbs, ears, costumes or a different species. Small slimes sized about half doorway height. Landscape is one continuous coherent homestead; open lawn for placement, connected paths, tiny growing plots, pond and tree clusters framing margins. No arbitrary new mechanics. UI uses opaque parchment cream, dark olive lettering, restrained warm wood edges and small custom filled hand-painted icons, never brown ornate RPG frames. Calm navigation and comfortably readable simplified Chinese; no tiny text. For phone images: one centered front-facing slim matte graphite generic phone, same device geometry across series, subtle visible bezel, no perspective tilt, consistent ivory outer canvas with balanced margins, content is hero. Six main bottom tabs exactly 陪伴 家园 召唤 探索 背包 成长, 家园 selected. Portrait composition 1024x1536 if possible, phone fills most height; no surrounding explanatory copy. For map and asset sheets, omit device frame.
Layout: 4 columns by 4 rows, SIXTEEN separated isolated complete objects, spacious consistent gutters, no touching, every object fits completely in its cell. Square canvas, high detail if possible 2048 x 2048. No text, numbers, labels, title, borders, cell outlines, logos or watermark. Background is a perfectly clean warm ivory #F8F3E7, fully opaque. All object edges have clean natural antialiasing against ivory. No black background, transparency, checkerboard, red/green edge halos or chromatic fringes. Same elevated front-facing orthographic view and same upper-left lighting across all assets. Objects aligned to a grounded baseline in each cell. Only small soft contact shadows; NO grass landscape pedestals or scenery circles under every object.
Draw exactly these 16 recognizable assets, in this row order:
1) the exact cream cottage from the reference, terracotta tile roof, brown arched doorway, warm window, stone doorstep, small flowerpot, no background;
2) a timber outdoor cooking workbench with cream canvas awning, little pot and compact attached stone stove, readable large shapes;
3) a timber carpenter's workbench with a few timber planks, hand saw and small mallet, no awning;
4) compact wooden storage hut with terracotta roof, a barrel and two crates.
5) wooden flower rack with three hanging cream pots and restrained white/pink flowers;
6) warm wood garden bench with slatted back;
7) one wood-post hanging amber glass lantern;
8) one connected pale wood picket fence segment, five pickets and two rails.
9) mature rounded deciduous tree, visible trunk and layered moss-green canopy;
10) smaller fruit tree with a few warm red-orange fruits, clearly different silhouette;
11) rectangular raised seedbed with orderly young green crops and visible soil;
12) one rooted clump of three yellow sunflowers at distinct heights.
13) a wood-frame seed windchime with two pale blue ceramic chimes;
14) low carved stone birdbath with shallow muted teal water and one tiny bird on edge;
15) tree-stump table with visible wood rings and two simple stump stools;
16) one mature luminous flower with green leaves and a soft golden cream blossom, compact subtle painted glow, magical accent restrained.
Keep asset silhouettes readable at game scale: fewer larger details, richer brush strokes in close view. Cohesive hand-painted storybook quality, soft dimensional shading, no glossy plastic, no isometric diamond bases, no perspective drift, no multiple little scenes.
